# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Not a song: a short jingle, played once as a sound (like music/jingles/victory.scrim).
# Played by audio/jingles.js: game/downed.js, helped up by a friend.
title    Revived
composer Claude
about    Back on your feet: the opposite of the death jingle, the bird's narrow call (A and Bb) opening to its wide one (A and B), with a crystal shimmer and a glass harmonica chord swelling in.
tempo    80
beats    2
steps    6
reverb   0.55

# mood explore: bird sweep harm

voice bird     crystal    vol=0.5  pan=0.35 rev=0.75
voice sweep    crystal    vol=0.26 pan=-0.3 rev=0.65
voice harm     glassharp  vol=0.22 pan=0    center=A4 att=0.3 rel=1

pattern up
bird    | A6 A5+Bb5---- A6 A5+B5---- |
sweep   | .----- A5 B5 E6 A6 B6- |
harm    | .----- [Aadd9]?----- |

loop up
